# TIER-C12 (2026-10-08): nested rule — the root .gitignore is not edited.
# Parquet and determinism twins stay out of git; their shas live in progress/*.json and PROGRESS.json.
**/*.parquet
**/_det_*/
# x_rec/ = byte copies of TC11-X's records and sources, read from the X worktree at its certified tip.
# They are X's to merge (the operator's close act), never TC12's to commit; X_REC_MANIFEST.json pins every sha.
x_rec/**
!x_rec/
!x_rec/X_REC_MANIFEST.json
